                "content": "## Landscape Overview (11 systems):\n- **corp.itsm**: ITSM system with agents for incident management, root cause analysis, change coordination, safety incidents\n  - Works with ServiceTicket, ITEquipment, ChangeRequest, Incident entities\n  - Has incident analysis and tracking capabilities\n- **sap.crm**: CRM system for sales, customer management, marketing\n- **sap.s4, sap.sf, sap.odm, sap.ehs, sap.ariba**: SAP systems\n- **emarsys.cx, workday.hcm, siemens.plm, my.mes**: Other domain systems\n\n## Key Finding:\nThe activity asks to \"pull up a recent issue that one of our customers reported last week\" to see \"what we promised to deliver\" and check \"current status.\"\n\nThis is fundamentally about **issue/ticket retrieval** with delivery promise tracking. The ORD landscape contains:\n1. **Agents** that monitor/analyze incidents/tickets (corp.itsm agents)\n2. NO **API resources** visible yet that provide read/query access to tickets\n\nThe corp.itsm agents are automation/orchestration agents, not query/retrieval APIs. This activity needs a simple query/read API to pull ticket data with delivery status.\n"
